+## Measured semantics
 
-These three properties of `src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts` are recorded so the hook features that follow specify against real behaviour. This issue changes none of them; each is a separate, out-of-scope change owned by no issue in this epic.
+- `beforeSession` runs inside the `try` block, so a throw there reaches `onError` and `afterSession` while still rejecting to the caller; `afterSession` can assume the turn aborted before provider interaction ([validated by: runs error and cleanup hooks when beforeSession aborts before provider interaction](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.beforeSession.cleanup.test.ts#L12), [runs onError and afterSession when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.beforeSession.acceptance.test.ts#L40)).
+
